description	"Maw

An intimidating Dark Jedi whose anger and repulsorlift prosthetics make him a musclebound, levitating incarnation of rage.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 25% slower RoF
- Lightsaber (Purple)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (1)
-- 10% longer
-- 10% more knockback
-- 10% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
--- 43% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Grip (2) ^3[CS3]
- Dark Rage (3) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Fury (3)
